# Internal prose stays out; runtime prompts and licenses may still be tracked.
/**/*.md
/**/*.mdx
!/README.md
!/DEVELOPMENT_REPOSITORY_SCOPE.md
!/**/src/**/*.md
!/**/LICENSE*.md
!/**/NOTICE*.md

# Reviewed developer and user guides are shareable.
!/guides/*.md
